# HotSpot API 规范 - 通知相关 API 模块 v0.0.1 (RPC)

> 本文档定义 HotSpot 通知中心 (`notifications`)、订阅设置 (`subscriptions`) 和设备令牌管理 (`device_tokens`) 相关的 RPC 接口。

## 服务定义

- **Service Namespace**: `notifications`, `subscriptions`, `device_tokens`
- **Base Path**: `/api/v1/notifications/`, `/api/v1/subscriptions/`, `/api/v1/device_tokens/`

## 核心类型定义

```typescript
interface NotificationItem {
  notification_id: string;
  type: NotificationType;
  is_read: boolean;
  created_at: string;
  sender?: UserInfo;
  title?: string;
  content?: string;
  target_type?: NotificationTargetType;
  target_id?: string | number;
  reference_id?: string;
  target_text_preview?: string;
  target_media_url?: string;
}

interface UnreadCount {
  total: number;
  breakdown?: {
    like: number;
    comment: number;
    follow: number;
    system: number;
    mention: number;
  };
}

interface Subscriptions {
  new_follower_enabled: boolean;
  mutual_follow_enabled: boolean;
  follow_request_enabled: boolean;            // 收到关注请求（需审批时）
  follow_request_handled_enabled: boolean;    // 关注请求被处理
  group_invite_enabled: boolean;
  group_invite_response_enabled: boolean;
  group_application_enabled: boolean;
  group_application_response_enabled: boolean;
  group_announcement_enabled: boolean;
  message_mention_enabled: boolean;
  moment_like_enabled: boolean;
  moment_comment_enabled: boolean;
  comment_reply_enabled: boolean;
  system_announcement_enabled: boolean;
}

interface DeviceTokenItem {
  device_token_id: string;
  platform: DevicePlatform;
  device_token: string;
  created_at: string;
}
```

## 错误码说明

本模块使用的错误码定义于 `@api_spec_errors.mdc`，主要涉及：

| 错误码 | 说明 | 相关接口 |
|-------|------|---------|
| `10001` | 缺少必填参数 | `device_tokens/register`、`device_tokens/unregister` |
| `10003` | 参数值超出范围 | `notifications`（limit）、`notifications/mark_read`（ids 数量） |

